{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.24,
   "text": "It was 11 acres of land in Taylorsville, Kentucky,"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.66,
   "end": 3.54,
   "text": "which for anybody that's listening"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.54,
   "end": 6.06,
   "text": "is about 30 minutes south of Louisville, Kentucky."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.66,
   "end": 9.0,
   "text": "And it's one of the best school districts in the Metro."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.24,
   "end": 10.42,
   "text": "So her kids go to school there."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.58,
   "end": 11.84,
   "text": "She's very familiar with the area."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.18,
   "end": 14.22,
   "text": "And so that was kind of our end with the knowledge."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.6,
   "end": 16.16,
   "text": "And the cool thing about this land"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.16,
   "end": 19.12,
   "text": "is most land is zoned agricultural out there."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.28,
   "end": 21.9,
   "text": "But this one, the owner went through the two year process"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.9,
   "end": 23.96,
   "text": "of getting it switched to B2 commercial,"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.34,
   "end": 25.42,
   "text": "meaning it could build literally"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.42,
   "end": 26.58,
   "text": "just about anything over there."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.04,
   "end": 29.1,
   "text": "And so we had a game plan to build townhomes"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.1,
   "end": 32.02,
   "text": "as well as storage, with storage being the first piece."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.44,
   "end": 34.92,
   "text": "And she brought me in to have the conversations"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.92,
   "end": 36.68,
   "text": "with the owner, which took about six months"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.68,
   "end": 38.24,
   "text": "to negotiate actually buying that land."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.1,
   "end": 41.6,
   "text": "But once we bought it, we kicked off ground quickly"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.6,
   "end": 45.46,
   "text": "on the storage, which cost about 2.2 million to build."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.08,
   "end": 48.92,
   "text": "And we just, our 50-50 partners is how we split that."
  }
 ],
